  "repo": "https://github.com/milochen0418/snake_duel",
  "icon": "<svg class=\"lucide lucide-worm\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" ><path d=\"m19 12-1.5 3\" /><path d=\"M19.63 18.81 22 20\" /><path d=\"M6.47 8.23a1.68 1.68 0 0 1 2.44 1.93l-.64 2.08a6.76 6.76 0 0 0 10.16 7.67l.42-.27a1 1 0 1 0-2.73-4.21l-.42.27a1.76 1.76 0 0 1-2.63-1.99l.64-2.08A6.66 6.66 0 0 0 3.94 3.9l-.7.4a1 1 0 1 0 2.55 4.34z\" /></svg>",
  "desc": {
   "en": "Snake against an AI: up to five snakes on one board after the same food. Pick how many snakes the arena holds and the people playing take the first seats, with AI snakes filling the rest — two of you in an arena of five means three AI snakes. Play alone, or open a room and share it: the link unfurls into a card with who is in and a picture of the board, you can invite whoever has the game open, and it works whenever it is opened (mid-match you watch, or take over an AI snake). Sign in and you play under your account's name and picture, with everyone's name over their snake; Call everyone rings the whole room so you can talk while you play. You steer your own snake with the arrow keys or by swiping; for each AI snake the model the AI Hub sets decides where it goes (which food to race for, or where to block), and the snake finds the way there. Gold ones are worth three points and crashes cost three; every match is kept per model and arena, so you can switch the model on the AI Hub and compare. Practice snakes play without any AI.",
   "zh": "雙蛇搶食：跟 AI 玩貪食蛇對戰，場上最多 5 條蛇。你先選場上要幾條蛇，真人先坐位子，剩下的由 AI 蛇補滿——兩個人玩 5 條，就補 3 條 AI 蛇。可以自己玩，也可以開房間分享給別人：連結貼到聊天室會變成一張卡片，看得到誰在裡面和場上畫面；也能直接邀請正開著遊戲的人；不管什麼時候點開連結都有用（比賽中就先觀戰，或接手一條 AI 蛇）。登入後用帳號的名字和頭像上場，每條蛇頭上都寫著是誰；按 Call everyone 就能打給整個房間，邊玩邊講。你用方向鍵（手機用滑的）控制自己的蛇；每條 AI 蛇都由 AI Hub 替它選的模型決定要去哪裡（搶哪一顆、或去哪裡擋路），蛇再自己找路過去。金果 3 分、撞到扣 3 分；每場結果按模型和場上蛇數記下來，在 AI Hub 換個模型再打就能比較。沒有 AI 也能跟內建的練習蛇玩。"
  },
